---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About | DesiFit"
  description="DesiFit is a lifestyle curation site — women’s and men’s lookbooks plus lean fitness tools for everyday desi living."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 md:px-6">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sand">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-bold text-ink md:text-5xl">Built for how people actually dress and move.</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      DesiFit is a lifestyle curation site for India. We put together shoppable women’s and men’s lookbooks — Indo-Western,
      everyday desi, accessories — and keep a lean Fitness studio with practical tools like a BMI check and a Desi food
      calorie index.
    </p>

    <section class="mt-12 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">What we do</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        Instead of dumping category pages, we curate complete looks with real product links to partner merchants. When you
        shop through those links, DesiFit may earn a commission at no extra cost to you — that’s how we keep the studio
        running.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        The Fitness door is intentional too: some visitors come for lifestyle and movement, not kurtas. We give them
        useful tools without forcing fashion CTAs — and we don’t sell supplements or clinical advice.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Who we are</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        DesiFit is run by the <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">DesiFit Team</strong> — a small group focused on
        curation, clear shopping paths, and a calm site experience. We care more about outfits that feel wearable and tools
        that are honest than about noise.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12 rounded-3xl border border-line bg-paper-2/70 p-6 md:p-8">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Explore</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">Pick the door that matches why you’re here.</p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/categories" class="rounded-full bg-ink px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-paper transition hover:bg-accent">
          Women’s lookbooks
        </a>
        <a href="/categories/mens" class="rounded-full border border-ink/15 bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-ink transition hover:border-accent">
          Men’s studio
        </a>
        <a href="/fitness" class="rounded-full border border-ink/15 bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-ink transition hover:border-accent">
          Fitness studio
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="rounded-full border border-ink/15 bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-ink transition hover:border-accent">
          Contact
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
